---
// V10 — DARK CINEMATIC POSTER
// Mørk premium baggrund med stor cinematic Newsreader-overskrift,
// gold/terracotta accent og elegant typography. Som et plakat-cover.
---

<section class="b-info-v10" id="info-v10">

  <div class="b-info-v10-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="b-info-v10-container">

    <div class="b-info-v10-mark">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18" fill="none" stroke="#c8965a" stroke-width="0.8"/>
        <path d="M12 20 L18 26 L28 14" fill="none" stroke="#c8965a" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
      <span>Carlsen Insights</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="b-info-v10-title">
      Stråtagets to <span class="b-info-v10-title-i">store spørgsmål</span>.
    </h2>
    <p class="b-info-v10-lede">
      Det husejere altid spørger om — og de ærlige svar fra vores tækkemestre.
    </p>

    <div class="b-info-v10-cards">

      <article class="b-info-v10-card">
        <div class="b-info-v10-card-head">
          <span class="b-info-v10-chap">Kapitel I</span>
          <span class="b-info-v10-chap-line"></span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="b-info-v10-q">
          <span class="b-info-v10-q-italic">Renovering</span><br/>
          eller nyt stråtag?
        </h3>
        <p>
          Hvis 70-80% af strået er sundt, renoverer vi. Nyt slidlag på 20-22 cm oven på det
          eksisterende, brandsikring beholdes (60 år), <strong>20-25 års forlænget levetid</strong>
          for ca. 1/3 af prisen for et nyt tag.
        </p>
        <p>
          Ved omfattende skader, lækager eller nedslidte flader — så bygger vi nyt. Vores
          tækkemænd er uddannet i renoveringsteknik fra Holland, og vi siger ærligt fra hvis
          renovering ikke giver mening.
        </p>
        <div class="b-info-v10-stat-row">
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat">
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-num">1/3</span>
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-lbl">af nyt-pris</span>
          </div>
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat-divider"></div>
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat">
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-num">25 år</span>
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-lbl">forlænget levetid</span>
          </div>
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat-divider"></div>
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat">
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-num">388,-</span>
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-lbl">pr. m²</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="b-info-v10-card">
        <div class="b-info-v10-card-head">
          <span class="b-info-v10-chap">Kapitel II</span>
          <span class="b-info-v10-chap-line"></span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="b-info-v10-q">
          Hvorfor<br/>
          <span class="b-info-v10-q-italic">algebehandling</span>?
        </h3>
        <p>
          Et stråtag er levende. <strong>Mug, alger og mos</strong> holder fugt — og strå der
          tørrer dårligt, nedbrydes hurtigere. Lunkerne fyldes med vand, frosten gør resten.
        </p>
        <p>
          Jævne flader, hurtig udtørring, og en manuel rensning hvert par år. Solen og vinden
          gør arbejdet — vi sørger for at de kan. <strong>Op til 20% længere levetid</strong>
          for taget.
        </p>
        <div class="b-info-v10-stat-row">
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat">
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-num">20%</span>
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-lbl">længere levetid</span>
          </div>
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat-divider"></div>
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat">
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-num">79,-</span>
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-lbl">pr. m² grundpakke</span>
          </div>
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat-divider"></div>
          <div class="b-info-v10-stat">
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-num">2.500,-</span>
            <span class="b-info-v10-stat-lbl">engangsbehandling</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <footer class="b-info-v10-foot">
      <div class="b-info-v10-foot-line"></div>
      <p>I tvivl? Vi besigtiger gratis. Ring <a href="tel:+4524248080">24 24 80 80</a>.</p>
      <div class="b-info-v10-foot-line"></div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .b-info-v10 {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: #1a1310;
    color: #f4ede2;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .b-info-v10-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 800px 400px at 50% 0%, rgba(200,150,90,0.08), transparent),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 600px 400px at 0% 100%, rgba(160,79,27,0.10), transparent),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 600px 400px at 100% 100%, rgba(160,79,27,0.10), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .b-info-v10-container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .b-info-v10-mark {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .b-info-v10-mark svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
  .b-info-v10-mark span {
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.36em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c8965a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .b-info-v10-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: #f4ede2;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .b-info-v10-title-i {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #c8965a;
  }
  .b-info-v10-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(244,237,226,0.7);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 72px;
  }

  .b-info-v10-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .b-info-v10-card {
    background: rgba(244,237,226,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200,150,90,0.18);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 48px 40px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  .b-info-v10-card-head {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .b-info-v10-chap {
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c8965a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .b-info-v10-chap-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(200,150,90,0.3);
  }
  .b-info-v10-q {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: #f4ede2;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .b-info-v10-q-italic {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #c8965a;
  }
  .b-info-v10-card p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(244,237,226,0.85);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .b-info-v10-card strong {
    color: #c8965a;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .b-info-v10-stat-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,150,90,0.22);
  }
  .b-info-v10-stat {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .b-info-v10-stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 1.85rem);
    color: #c8965a;
    line-height: 1;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .b-info-v10-stat-lbl {
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(244,237,226,0.6);
  }
  .b-info-v10-stat-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 36px;
    background: rgba(200,150,90,0.22);
    margin: 0 8px;
  }

  .b-info-v10-foot {
    display: flex; align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 72px;
  }
  .b-info-v10-foot-line {
    flex: 1; height: 1px;
    background: rgba(200,150,90,0.22);
  }
  .b-info-v10-foot p {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: rgba(244,237,226,0.85);
    margin: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .b-info-v10-foot a {
    color: #c8965a;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .b-info-v10-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .b-info-v10-stat-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
    .b-info-v10-stat-divider { width: 36px; height: 1px; margin: 0; }
    .b-info-v10-foot { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .b-info-v10-foot p { white-space: normal; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
